WEBVTT

00:09:00.134 --> 00:09:03.729
Potrebna je velika raznolikost
kemičnih elementov

00:09:03.753 --> 00:09:06.761
in potrebne so tekočine, denimo voda.

00:09:06.785 --> 00:09:07.832
Zakaj?

00:09:07.856 --> 00:09:11.728
No, v plinih se atomi tako hitro
gibljejo drug mimo drugega,

00:09:11.752 --> 00:09:13.205
da se ne morejo zaplesti.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.836
V trdnih snoveh

00:09:14.836 --> 00:09:16.846
so atomi ujeti skupaj,

00:09:16.846 --> 00:09:18.000
ne morejo se premikati.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.718
V tekočinah

00:09:19.742 --> 00:09:22.780
lahko križarijo in se stiskajo

00:09:22.804 --> 00:09:25.106
in se zvežejo v molekule.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.135
Kje najdeš take Zlatolaskine pogoje?

00:09:28.674 --> 00:09:30.666
No, planeti so imenitni